+| Gap | U: unique verdict / remaining fork | FA: false acceptance | HR: honest rejection | L/A/B and proposed disposition |
+|---|---|---|---|---|
+| G01 | Set equality is unique; mixed known/unknown forms still need reason priority. | None found once both channel checks remain mandatory. | Default STMT_DIRECT path passes; spike uses STMT_DIGEST and is not conforming V1 evidence. | New owner required-set selection, not an extraction of illustrative vectors. No amendment if within A9's delegated fixed set. No codec/golden changes; add policy cases. Fix mixed-array reason by first offending element in canonical order. |
+| G02 | Numeric rule unique; chronology meaning remains wrong. | F01: post-receipt assertion can satisfy purported pre-commitment. | Wait-first future issue path can pass; prior complete-at-ship alone does not guarantee it. | CORRECT plus new profile restriction; author/amendment conditional on C4 chronology meaning. F01. |
+| G03 | Lowest height unique after G05, but not A9's only possible reading. | No cryptographic forgery; boundary divergence in F03. | Honest multi-branch proof can reject under height selection when time selection passes. | Explicit owner interpretation; amend if registered meaning differs. Existing P8 bytes unchanged. F03. |
+| G04 | Inclusion+five successors unique. | None found within pinned-history assumptions. | Nonmonotone times can give confirmed_at < T; do not add an unstated monotonicity test. | Honest CLARIFY for depth count; header-time proxy is newly explicit. Add same-segment, equality, nonmonotone controls; no P8 change. |
+| G05 | Coverage/linkage quantifiers and C6 reading need settlement. | No new cryptographic accept from pruning; C6 coverage divergence possible. | Ignoring absent upgraded branches avoids an unnecessary honest reject. | Explicit policy choice and A9 reading; amendment conditional. F02. |
+| G06 | Same depth/T rule is precise; c3 is newly added. | None found; adds a check. | Snapshot stamped before receipt need not confirm earlier; distinct calendars/branches can confirm in different order. Receipt c3 passing does not imply snapshot c3. | Label snapshot c3 a new owner acceptance restriction, not existing CLARIFY. Require issuer check and recapture/retry before ship; add receipt-pass/snapshot-c3-fail control. No P8 layout change. |
